<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - M.A. Hanna targets raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - M.A. Hanna targets raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Everen Securities Inc said Thursday it raised its price targets for M.A. Hanna Co to $24 a share from $23 for the six-month period and to $30 from $27 for the 18-month.</p>
<p>-- M.A. Hanna shares were up 1/8 at 21-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Everen has a near-term market perform rating and a long-term outperform rating on the stock.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
